  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "法律實作",
    "sub_ename": "LEGAL PRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程規劃至台中律師公會或其他單位學習法律實作，使學生於課堂所學理論能結合實務加以印證，並了解法律實務界現況。藉由法律實作，學生將更明瞭自己未來的生涯規劃。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is planned to study legal practice at the Taichung Bar Association or other organizations, so that students can combine the theories learned in law school with practice to prove and understand the current situation of the legal practice world. Through practical legal work, students will have a better understanding of their future career plans.",
